          "body": "LUCENE-1484.patch\n\n- FieldsReader implements Cloneable\n- fieldsReaderLocal added to SegmentReader\n- TestIndexReader, TestFieldsReader, TestSegmentReader, TestParallelMultiSearcher passes",
